{"timestamp": 1779425134.186245, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 16, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779425194.4785895, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I just found Alice's body in navigation. My path this round was upper engine, over to oxygen, then down through lower engine and storage before finally heading into navigation. I actually didn't cross paths with a single person that entire route until I found the body. \n\nSince Charlie is also dead, it looks like a lot happened this round. The killer in nav must have left through security or weapons before I arrived from storage, or they vented. Did anyone see someone heading towards or away from the right side of the map? Let's get everyone's locations."}}
{"timestamp": 1779425215.0528948, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My path this round was electrical, then medbay, upper engine, and finally lower engine, which is where I am right now. \n\nEarly on, right around tick 4, I saw Diana enter electrical coming from medbay. After that, I was alone for the rest of my route. Frank, I didn't cross paths with you in upper or lower engine, so you must have been a step ahead of me on that left-side rotation before heading to storage. \n\nSince Frank found Alice all the way down in navigation, and Charlie's body is still missing, the killer has been busy. The right side of the map (security, weapons) or the bottom right seems like the danger zone. \n\nDiana, where did you head after we crossed paths in electrical? And Bob, since you haven't spoken yet, we really need to hear your entire route. Where have you been, and did you happen to see Charlie anywhere?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779426206.0086403, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": ""}}
{"timestamp": 1779426229.5159469, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I started in medbay, then moved through electrical and security, and ended up in weapons. I didn't encounter a single person this entire round. Eve, it's interesting you say you saw me in electrical, because I didn't see you there at all. \n\nAs for the body in navigation: since I was holding down the right side of the map in security and weapons and didn't see anyone pass through, the killer didn't escape north from nav. They either vented, went back through storage, or Frank is self-reporting. \n\nHowever, Bob just stayed completely silent during this meeting, which is highly suspicious given we have two dead. Since we're down to four players, a wrong vote could cost us the game. I don't feel fully confident voting anyone right now, so I'm going to skip, but Bob and Eve are at the top of my suspect list.\n\nskip"}}
